                <pb facs="1911" n="1889" sameAs="frus:frus1950v05/pg1889"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following error has been identified in <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations</hi>, 1950, Volume V, The Near East, South Asia, and Africa.
                    Please be aware that printed volumes have not been revised.
                    <!--Revised information is in italic.--></p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#terms">List of Abbreviations and
                                Symbols</ref> (date of errata entry: January 7, 2016)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The abbreviation GNA is incorrectly defined as “Greek National Army.” The
                        correct definition in the context of this volume is “Grand National Assembly
                        (Turkey).”</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
